Additional boot health checks, one NAME.toml per check:

    exec = "/usr/libexec/..."     absolute path; run without a shell
    args = ["--quick"]            optional
    required = true               false (the default) only marks the boot degraded
    timeout = 30                  seconds, 1 to 600

A required check that exits non-zero, cannot be run or runs out of time
fails the gate. None is shipped today.
